      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found out you can \"reset\" it if you click on other avatar from your avatar list and load it. But this is not convenient step, because especially less experienced users will not know this is also possible.\n\nWith button to Disable / Unequip look, you can stay at your avatar, just accessory on your current avatar will removed. It just make easier and more clear. Quicker too because you don't need go to avatar list and find the avatar there and load it. \n\nProbably also it because you need swap to another avatar to unequip it, because on same avatar it might not work - i have not confirmed it yet but i think it's not possible.",
